    "body": "Hi. I investigated this issue.\r\n\r\nI think this may be because directory path is falsely determined to be truncated.\r\nAt `is_truncated` method in directory module, starship determines whether directory path is truncated.\r\nIn this method, It is checked that the directory path has home symbol or root.\r\n\r\nMaybe, when using directory substitution, directory path lost home symbol or root, so starship falsely determined the truncation and display truncation symbol.\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/starship/starship/blob/dc92d664e22f945645c3ac124a592285d5109894/src/modules/directory.rs#L148-L152",
